# Folder structure

```text
src/app/[locale]/         → routes; import feature pages by path
src/api/generated/        → Orval output only
src/features/<feature>/   → pages/, components/, hooks/, …
src/components/ui/        → shadcn primitives
src/components/common/    → complex shared UI
src/messages/             → en.json, fa.json
src/i18n/                 → next-intl config
src/lib/api/client.ts     → Axios instance
src/stores/               → Zustand (non-theme)
```

- No feature barrels — `app` imports `features/<name>/pages/...` directly.
- Aliases: `@/*`, `@/features/*`, `@/components/*`, `@/lib/*`, `@/messages/*`.
- Locale layout: next-intl + `lang`/`dir` + ThemeProvider.
